{"title":"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 27","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/e/33e4e82e56f659002e84903e88b7f1de4d85a4ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_n=1-2+3-4+\\cdots +(-1)^{n-1}n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"287\" height=\"19\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/1/ef16b40a936a51c7ef5238812c2e5f7124a344dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1,2,\\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/b/2fb374b1f75e07eebb0e922698f0758e4844eaf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_{17}+S_{33}+S_{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"118\" height=\"15\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/0/5406ce311691c150b86d74edfa555841589a078a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 0\\quad \\text{(B) } 1\\quad \\text{(C) } 2\\quad \\text{(D) } -1\\quad \\text{(E) } -2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"308\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is even, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/d/3bde7059c6b5b207061a12fbd17380fbdff0ea6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" /> is negative <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/3/c8332f3acf37eb5aeaeca80118fd58e33bd93d25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"18\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is odd, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/d/3bde7059c6b5b207061a12fbd17380fbdff0ea6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/5/9751a9feb47425ab2a6a9843788db1b84e9df5d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n+1)/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" />.\n(These can be found using simple calculations.)\nTherefore, we know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/b/2fb374b1f75e07eebb0e922698f0758e4844eaf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_{17}+S_{33}+S_{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"118\" height=\"15\" /> =<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/b/daba48d185d06758e3e444f0c52181a21cd7433f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9+17-25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"89\" height=\"14\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c3218ca790f4eac4048f34f68433655b19e1f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nSolution By FrostFox\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME\" title=\"1968 AHSME\">1968 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1968 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1968\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1968 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1968_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" t